// Cells. A mirror maze (m: a mirror, solid; f: one of the four false mirrors, walkable and drawn as a
// mirror with a lighter frame; the source's "no silhouette" mirror has no tile). The four false mirrors:
// (1, 10) and (3, 14) are shortcuts, (18, 19) leads to the hidden Max Revive's pocket (17, 19), and
// (6, 11) leads to prism p3's pocket (5, 11). Prisms p1 (2, 19), p2 (12, 13), p3 (5, 12) are solid (p).
// P (11, 4) is the prism door (a fourth prism, the seal), solid until TourNebula_4F_OnLoad opens it (FLAG_SIL_REFLETS_PORTE_OUVERTE:
// metatile 652, collision 0). V (11, 0) is the vault door in the back wall (513-515), D (10, 24) the
// elevator door, closed (a sign). The hall (row 23) has two ways into the maze, (1, 22) and (19, 22).
[
    Ascii(x: 0, y: 0, rows: [
        "#######wvw123wvw######",
        "######m---------m#####",
        "######m.........m#####",
        "######m.........m#####",
        "#######mmmmPmmmm######",
        "mmmmmmmmm.....mmmmmmmm",
        "mmmmmmmmmmm.mmmmmmmmmm",
        "m.m.....m.......m...mm",
        "m.mmm.m.m.mmmmm.m.m.mm",
        "m...m.m.......m...m.mm",
        "mfm.mmmmmmmmmmmmmmm.mm",
        "m.m.m.f...m.......m.mm",
        "m.m.mpm.m.m.mmmmm.m.mm",
        "m.m.....m...p.....m.mm",
        "m.mfmmmmmmmmm.mmmmm.mm",
        "m...m.......m...m...mm",
        "m.m.m.mmm.m.mmm.m.m.mm",
        "m.m.m.m...m...m...m.mm",
        "m.m.m.m.mmmmm.mmmmm.mm",
        "m.p.m.m.....m...m.f.mm",
        "m.m.m.mmmmm.mmmmmmm.mm",
        "m.m.......m.........mm",
        "m.mmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmm.mm",
        "m....................m",
        "cbcbcbcbcbDbcbcbcbcbcb",
        "ededededededededededed",
    ], legend: {
        '#': (metatile: 1, collision: 1, elevation: 0),
        'm': (metatile: 653, collision: 1, elevation: 0),
        'f': (metatile: 645, collision: 0, elevation: 3),
        'p': (metatile: 522, collision: 1, elevation: 0),
        'P': (metatile: 522, collision: 1, elevation: 3),
        '.': (metatile: 652, collision: 0, elevation: 3),
        '-': (metatile: 626, collision: 0, elevation: 3),
        'w': (metatile: 517, collision: 1, elevation: 0), 'v': (metatile: 516, collision: 1, elevation: 0),
        '1': (metatile: 513, collision: 1, elevation: 0), '2': (metatile: 514, collision: 1, elevation: 0), '3': (metatile: 515, collision: 1, elevation: 0),
        'b': (metatile: 726, collision: 1, elevation: 0), 'c': (metatile: 725, collision: 1, elevation: 0),
        'd': (metatile: 841, collision: 1, elevation: 0), 'e': (metatile: 840, collision: 1, elevation: 0),
        'D': (metatile: 837, collision: 1, elevation: 0),
    }),
